    "Every complete actual run requires separate strict raw/canonical/source and event/tube arithmetic replay.",
    "No historical novelty, continuum/PDE or baseline action-potential conclusion.",
    "Runtime range is explicit60..21600-second wall and1024..8192 MiB sampled high-water RSS; actual launch must obey its separately authorized budget.",
